# Demo layout standards

## Feature section spacing

Use `FEATURE_SECTION_GAP_STANDARD_PX` (24px) for the gap above the feature grid section.
Apply via `FEATURE_SECTION_GAP_PX` in `src/lib/demoLayout.ts`.

## Feature card spacing

Use a single consistent `FEATURE_CARD_GAP_PX` for all feature cards in the grid.
Do not apply per-card margin overrides in `FeatureGrid.tsx`.

## Theme hints

Reveal trail hint text must use `CURSOR_MUTED_TEXT` from `demoTheme.ts`, not `PAGE_BACKGROUND`.
